<title>USA: HFS plans to franchise four hotels in Israel.</title>
<headline>HFS plans to franchise four hotels in Israel.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>HFS Inc said Monday that it has signed a master franchise agreement for the development of Howard Johnson hotels in Israel with Israel Land Development Co Ltd.</p>
<p>The agreement, said the company, will bring four resort properties in Eilat, Zevad, Safed and Tiberias into the Howard Johnson International fold within a month.</p>
</text>
